(Northwind Labs GmbH - Business Travel Policy) Tj T*
(Version 2.1, valid from 1 March 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Approval) Tj T*
(Every business trip must be approved by your team lead before booking.) Tj T*
(Trips outside Europe also need approval from the Head of Finance.) Tj T*
(Submit the travel request in the TravelDesk tool at least 14 days in advance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Transport) Tj T*
(Train is the default for trips under 600 km. Book second class.) Tj T*
(First class is allowed for train rides longer than 4 hours.) Tj T*
(Flights are allowed for distances over 600 km. Always book economy class.) Tj T*
(Business class is only allowed for flights longer than 8 hours.) Tj T*
(Taxis are reimbursed up to 50 EUR per ride. Use public transport when possible.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
