stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 60 780 Td
(3. Hotels) Tj T*
(The hotel budget is 140 EUR per night in Germany.) Tj T*
(In London, Paris and Zurich the hotel budget is 220 EUR per night.) Tj T*
(Book hotels through TravelDesk to get the company rate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Meals and per diem) Tj T*
(Employees receive a per diem of 28 EUR for each full travel day in Germany.) Tj T*
(For trips abroad the per diem is 40 EUR per full day.) Tj T*
(Client dinners must be approved by your team lead and need a receipt.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Expense reports) Tj T*
(Submit your expense report within 30 days after the trip.) Tj T*
(Upload all receipts as PDF or photo in the ExpenseHub app.) Tj T*
(Reimbursement is paid with the next monthly salary.) Tj T*
(Questions about travel: write to travel@northwind-labs.example.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
